# ユーザ環境設定 as 利用者 (design 8.7.1, 11.6), for tools/ui_run.py: started from its
# program as the desktop starts it. The name and the zone are the person's to set:
# the name is kept in ユーザ情報 and the zone (the offset and the name of the place chosen) in 暦 with no question. The time server
# is in the network's settings, the administrator's: keeping it asks the desktop for
# the administrator's password, and the panel put away leaves it as it was while the
# rest is kept. The window is at 180,90: 使用者 at 600,175, 時刻サーバ at 600,388,
# タイムゾーン at 500,425 (↑ the next zone east); Ctrl+E closes, and 更新して終了 of the
# question that comes (in the middle of the screen) is at 790,440.
open 01a0d8c4-52b7-7c63-8e83-4f9a012c3d53
expect userenv: ready
wait 800
click 600 175
text 2
click 500 425
key 52
expect userenv: zone Australia/Adelaide
wait 300
click 600 388
text x
wait 300
key 08 01
wait 800
move 790 440
wait 150
click 790 440
wait 1000
shot ue_admin
key 29
expect userenv: the time server not set: no right
expect userenv: kept
wait 500
shot ue_kept
# opened again: the name and the zone as kept
open 01a0d8c4-52b7-7c63-8e83-4f9a012c3d53
wait 1500
win ユーザ環境設定
shot ue_again
